guarantee: AC-3: a connect error maps to network
file: crates/voicen-core/src/engine/openai.rs
added_by: test-writer
--- old
        FailureReason::NetworkUnavailable | FailureReason::CannotReach { .. } => {
            FailReason::Network
        }
--- new
        FailureReason::NetworkUnavailable => FailReason::Network,
        FailureReason::CannotReach { .. } => FailReason::Provider,
--- end
